'''The Slaves of Zygerria''' is a featurette appearing on the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars The Complete Season Four]]'' DVD set and focusing on the [[Zygerrian/Legends|Zygerrian]] story arc of the [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]] of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series.

The 22-minute-long feature is narrated by director [[Dave Filoni]], writer [[Henry Gilroy]] and artist [[Kilian Plunkett]] and deals with the adaptation of Gilroy's [[Star Wars: The Clone Wars: Slaves of the Republic|''Star Wars: The Clone Wars: Slaves of the Republic'' comic book series]] into episodes of the show.

